All in `backend/app/core/config.py` and documented in `.env.prod.example`. Every default is
off or empty.

| variable | default | what it does |
|---|---|---|
| `CRM_LINK_ENABLED` | `false` | **THE KILL SWITCH.** False → the hook returns before touching the DB, every `/api/crm-link` route 503s, nothing is queued. |
| `CRM_LINK_BASE_URL` | `http://ghl_clone_api:8000` | The CRM on the internal docker network. Never a public URL. |
| `CRM_LINK_TOKEN` | `` | The CRM machine token. **Needs `events:write` AND `read`** — see §7.1. |
| `CRM_LINK_ALLOWLIST` | `` | The hard destination allowlist. Comma-separated. **Empty allows nothing.** |
| `CRM_LINK_SMS_ENABLED` | `false` | The SMS dark switch, on top of the platform's own 10DLC gate. |
| `CRM_LINK_MAX_PSTN_LEGS` | `2` | Most PSTN numbers a ring group may ring. |
| `CRM_LINK_RING_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` | `25` | Default ring time; a binding row may override per number. |
